    "title": "iFunny - memes, videos & jokes",
    "description": "If memes are the universal love language \u2014 we're here with a massive dictionary of memes! With millions of users and endless humor, iFunny is your go-to source for the funniest, weirdest, and most trending viral content in this Universe and beyond. Get ready to smile!\r\n\r\nYou'll never be bored, and here's why:\r\n\r\nPersonalized Feed: iFunny\u2019s smart algorithm learns your sense of humor and delivers posts tailored just for you. Like and comment to build (or destroy) your feed filled with meme that make you smile.\r\n\r\nEndless Content: No matter how your mood, interest, or day looks like \u2014 there's a meme to describe it and 100 more to have fun about it. With thousands of jokes and funny videos and pictures at your fingertips, you\u2019ll always find something that makes you laugh. Plus, with our meme maker app, you can create your own!\r\n\r\nCreative Studio: Unleash your creativity with our meme maker app! Create your masterpieces or the absolute worst memes possible in the Studio. Share them with the iFunny community or on your favorite social media platforms. The possibilities are endless!\r\n\r\nHuge Community: Join a vibrant community where you can watch, comment, discuss, and have fun together. Follow your favorite accounts or become one of the top creators out there. Divide jokes and memes that will make everyone smile, along with funny videos and pictures that showcase your humor!\r\n\r\nCustom Profile: Make your profile truly yours! Personalize your bio, choose from a variety of backgrounds, color your nickname, add a premium badge, and let your style shine. Show off your favorite memes and share your unique sense of humor with the world, including your best jokes!\r\n\r\nKeep it Funny: iFunny is not just about consuming content; it's about creating and sharing joy. Whether you're looking for the latest memes, jokes to tell your friends, or funny videos and pictures to brighten your day, we\u2019ve got you covered with our meme maker app!\r\n\r\nJoin millions of users who are already laughing out loud with iFunny! Download now to explore the best memes, share your own creations, and keep the smile coming.\r\n\r\nStay connected with us:\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/ifunny\r\nX (Twitter): https://x.com/iFunny\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/iFunny  \r\nTerms of Use: https://ifunny.co/docs/tos_for_inapp\r\n\r\nIf you have any problems with the app, get support at support@ifunny.co.",
    "descriptionHTML": "If memes are the universal love language \u2014 we&#39;re here with a massive dictionary of memes! With millions of users and endless humor, iFunny is your go-to source for the funniest, weirdest, and most trending viral content in this Universe and beyond. Get ready to smile!<br><br>You&#39;ll never be bored, and here&#39;s why:<br><br>Personalized Feed: iFunny\u2019s smart algorithm learns your sense of humor and delivers posts tailored just for you. Like and comment to build (or destroy) your feed filled with meme that make you smile.<br><br>Endless Content: No matter how your mood, interest, or day looks like \u2014 there&#39;s a meme to describe it and 100 more to have fun about it. With thousands of jokes and funny videos and pictures at your fingertips, you\u2019ll always find something that makes you laugh. Plus, with our meme maker app, you can create your own!<br><br>Creative Studio: Unleash your creativity with our meme maker app! Create your masterpieces or the absolute worst memes possible in the Studio. Share them with the iFunny community or on your favorite social media platforms. The possibilities are endless!<br><br>Huge Community: Join a vibrant community where you can watch, comment, discuss, and have fun together. Follow your favorite accounts or become one of the top creators out there. Divide jokes and memes that will make everyone smile, along with funny videos and pictures that showcase your humor!<br><br>Custom Profile: Make your profile truly yours! Personalize your bio, choose from a variety of backgrounds, color your nickname, add a premium badge, and let your style shine. Show off your favorite memes and share your unique sense of humor with the world, including your best jokes!<br><br>Keep it Funny: iFunny is not just about consuming content; it&#39;s about creating and sharing joy. Whether you&#39;re looking for the latest memes, jokes to tell your friends, or funny videos and pictures to brighten your day, we\